{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21052","headline":"神仙曲 · 李贺","name":"神仙曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧峰海面藏灵书，上帝拣作神仙居。\n清明笑语闻空虚，鬬乘巨浪骑鲸鱼。\n春罗书字邀王母，共讌红楼最深处。\n鹤羽冲风过海迟，不如却使青龙去。\n犹疑王母不相许，垂露娃鬟更传语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}